    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="280" width="366" height="56">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(241,226,194)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p><strong>① 同事务落表</strong>：改文件状态为待处理，同时写入一条待发送记录，提交即一致。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="348" width="366" height="56">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(241,226,194)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p><strong>② 异步投递</strong>：事务提交后由线程池投递到 Kafka，不阻塞上传主链路。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="416" width="366" height="64">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(241,226,194)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p><strong>③ 失败补发</strong>：线程池满或网络抖动，每 5 秒定时任务指数退避扫描补发，封顶 300 秒。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

