      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="380" width="366" height="56">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(241,226,194)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p><strong>③ 解析切块</strong>：PDF 走 LiteParse 保页码；其余 21 种格式走 Apache Tika（22 种白名单）。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="442" width="366" height="48">
